  "readme": "Project source, build instructions and patch sets: https://github.com/xiaoxiao44443/DSH-Sugar\nSucrune source: https://github.com/xiaoxiao44443/Sucrune/tree/c21af1309a904c8ab916db2e22f35002b669a0e4\nDeepSeek Harness: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/tree/dsh-v0.2.2-rc.5\nNode.js source: https://nodejs.org/download/release/v24.22.2/node-v24.22.2.tar.xz\nThe npm lock in this archive lists pinned DSH distribution packages and their integrity hashes. npm 11.19.1 and pnpm 10.28.2 are separate command-line programs.\n\nAndroid libraries: LibADB Android 3.1.1 (Apache-2.0 option, component files also carry BSD/MIT notices), SPAKE2 Java 2.2.1 (LGPL-3.0; source included), Conscrypt Android 2.5.3, Bouncy Castle 1.81 and AndroidX.\n\nThe companion debian-corresponding-source.zip includes Debian source packages; debian/index.json maps the packaged binaries to Debian source versions. The guest package includes the LibreOffice kit WASM build sources, exact upstream checkout identifiers and patch series below guest/opt/dsh/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/libreoffice-kit-wasm/sources. The sharp/libvips build scripts are provided below runtime/sharp-libvips. Component notices retain their original terms.\n",
